BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fed-709-2025-04-15@ustaxcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20260924T122623Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250416
SUMMARY:Federal: 709 due
DESCRIPTION:Same due date as the individual income tax return | Form 709 fo
 r 2025 gifts is due April 15\, 2026. An extension of the donor's 2025 Form 
 1040 automatically extends the Form 709 due date\; if the income tax return
  is not being extended\, Form 8892 requests a separate automatic 6-month ex
 tension. Extensions to file do not extend the deadline to pay any gift or G
 ST tax due. | Authority: IRS Instructions for Form 709: "Generally\, you mu
 st file Form 709 no earlier than January 1\, but not later than April 15\, 
 of the year after the gift was made." | Source: https://www.irs.gov/instruc
 tions/i709 | This date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not refle
 ct a later-announced change\; confirm against the cited source before relyi
 ng on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
