DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280731
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280801
SUMMARY:Federal: 2290 due
DESCRIPTION:Due by the last day of the month following first use in June 20
 27 | Form 2290 for a vehicle first used on a public highway during June 202
 7 is due 2027-08-02\, per the IRS Instructions for Form 2290's month-of-fir
 st-use filing table for the July 2026 - June 2027 tax period. If a due date
  falls on a weekend or legal holiday\, the return is due the next business 
 day. | Authority: IRS Instructions for Form 2290 (July 2026 - June 2027 tax
  period filing table): "file by the last day of the month following the mon
 th of first use." | Source: https://www.irs.gov/instructions/i2290 | This d
 ate is computed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-announce
 d change\; confirm against the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
